# H5 (run 5 of 5): the AUDITS-OFF HANG SHAPES at eight seats on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-w2 (the wave-2 stack on the control's audits-off profile). The hang is unexplained and sensitive to the trace shape; wave 2 changes the trace in two places on top of wave 1: ONE multi-user SDPA launch per attention layer replaces the per-user launches (hang-clean 5 of 5 as its
# own arm, never together with wave 1's nosamp, drafter ops, host-gap stage 1 and unit-major reduce-scatter) and the block conv-gates launch is a generic_op twin with the gate tiles on cores of their own. Five consecutive completions are required.
# The shapes: concurrent4_steady, concurrent8_steady (the quad blocks' mix), steady_resend, replay_concurrent4 and replay_concurrent8, the exactness reference concurrent8_code_equal, then the split-block and drain shapes. Each run follows its own all-four reset.
# READ: every user at budget, c2_smoke_check clean (the F1 and SDPA engaged markers, no fell-back line), no watchdog or replay-deadline exit, NO "[PINDIAG] packed sampler arm" line (nosamp took effect), the concurrent8_code_equal hashes equal in every run and equal to the control's (S0c). No stall watch on this profile:
# a stall waits for the job timeout and records nothing, which is itself the finding. Duration (estimate): 90 min. Stop rule: one stall stops the window.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/w2 eight-seat 262k wave-2 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/w2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-w2-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/w2 commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-w2-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-w2
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent4_steady,concurrent8_steady,steady_resend,replay_concurrent4,replay_concurrent8,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent5_split,concurrent8_drain
